editor_description = "One 감독 능력치 card of ManagerTab's 6-column row: icon + name on top, an adjust strip at the bottom — − value + . Spec mode: value = stat incl. specialisation (amber when specialised), steppers shown only when a step is possible. Removal mode (removal points left): strip turns light green (ManagerStatAdjustRemove), value = base after the pending removals (red while lowered), − places a removal, + takes one back. ManagerTab fills everything."
